      "text": {
        "hi": "किताब में नौ ग्रहों के नाम हैं: Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune, Pluto। ध्यान दो: 2006 में वैज्ञानिकों ने Pluto को ‘बौना ग्रह’ (dwarf planet) कहना शुरू किया। अब सौर मंडल में आठ ग्रह माने जाते हैं।",
        "hinglish": "Kitaab mein nau grahon ke naam hain: Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune, Pluto. Dhyaan do: 2006 mein vaigyaanikon ne Pluto ko ‘bauna grah’ (dwarf planet) kehna shuru kiya. Ab saur mandal mein aath grah maane jaate hain.",
        "en": "The book lists nine planets: Mercury, Venus, Earth, Mars, Jupiter, Saturn, Uranus, Neptune, Pluto. Note: in 2006 scientists started calling Pluto a ‘dwarf planet’. Now the solar system is said to have eight planets."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "B6.11.5.S02",
      "skills": [
        "book.activity",
        "vocab.nature"
      ],
      "question": "M____ is the planet closest to the sun.",
